lemetry-go\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-15\\n\\n## Sources\\n\\n- `SRC-PR-04` — [opentelemetry-go-7427.md](../opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md)\\n\\n- `SRC-PR-05` — [opentelemetry-go-7443.md](../opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md)\\n\\n- `SRC-PR-06` — [opentelemetry-go-7474.md](../opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7474.md)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"src note 07 entri 3581463689 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3581463689 md src mile 02 mileston 13145551 md opentelemetri mileston mileston 13145551 md src mile 03 mileston 13661613 md opentelemetri mileston mileston 13661613 md src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 md opentelemetri releas releas v1 39 0 md w 02 metric perform status in _ progress prioriti p0 owner dashpol project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 12 15 decis and supersed direct tempor selector configur t004 on 2025 10 09 the sig reject expos custom tempor selector pars in the sdk in favor of the full opentelemetri configur file format src note 03 on 2025 10 16 the prior expos tempor selector function pr wa describ a api pollut and slate for closur src note 04 separ v1 39 0 releas tempor selector function 7434 deltatemporalityselector cumulativetemporalityselector lowmemorytemporalityselector src rel 01 perform sequenc on 2025 10 02 the sig accept the concurr sum approach and order counter work ahead of histogram fix size work src note 02 w 02 metric perform status in _ progress prioriti p0 owner dashpol project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 12 15 sourc src pr 04 opentelemetri go 7427 md opentelemetri pull opentelemetri go 7427 md src pr 05 opentelemetri go 7443 md opentelemetri pull opentelemetri go 7443 md src pr 06 opentelemetri go 7474 md opentelemetri pull opentelemetri go 7474 md\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"cf971b288a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"id\": \"ad5ab39aee6c734e\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.44877544640796385, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.3274702948685198, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7318208, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"cf971b288a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"location\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 4565, \"chunk_count\": 9, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:48:43\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:37\", \"token_count\": 4834, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"work-state\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**Tag**: `v1.39.0`  \\n\\n**Published**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Overview\\n\\n### Added\\n\\n- Greatly reduce the cost of recording metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` using hashing for map keys. (#7175)\\n\\n- Add `WithInstrumentationAttributeSet` option to `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace` packages. This provides a concurrent-safe and performant alternative to `WithInstrumentationAttributes` by accepting a pre-constructed `attribute.Set`. (#7287)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability for the Prometheus exporter in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. Check the `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus/internal/x` package documentation for more information. (#7345)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7353)\\n\\n- Add temporality selector functions `DeltaTemporalitySelector`, `CumulativeTemporalitySelector`, `LowMemoryTemporalitySelector` to `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7434)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for simple log processor in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. (#7548)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7459)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7486)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for simple span processor in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace`. (#7374)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z tag v1 39 0 publish 2025 12 08t16 45 46z overview ad great reduc the cost of record metric in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric use hash for map key 7175 add withinstrumentationattributeset option to go opentelemetri io otel log go opentelemetri io otel metric and go opentelemetri io otel trace packag this provid a concurr safe and perform altern to withinstrumentationattribut by accept a pre construct attribut set 7287 add experiment observ for the prometheus export in go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus check the go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus intern x packag document for more inform 7345 add experiment observ metric in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7353 add tempor selector function deltatemporalityselector cumulativetemporalityselector lowmemorytemporalityselector to go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7434 add experiment observ metric for simpl log processor in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log 7548 add experiment observ metric in g