for acm.org which blocks the link checker by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7444\\n\\n* feat: logs SDK observability - otlploggrpc exporter metrics by @yumosx in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7353\\n\\n* fix(deps): update golang.org/x to 27f1f14 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7448\\n\\n* fix(deps): update googleapis to 7c0ddcb by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7449\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/grpc-ecosystem/grpc-gateway/v2 to v2.27.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7450\\n\\n* Add exemplar reservoir parallel benchmarks by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7441\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/ghostiam/protogetter to v0.3.17 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7451\\n\\n* chore(deps): update actions/stale action to v10.1.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7452\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"chore dep updat golang org x telemetri digest to 4eae98a by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7439 chore dep updat peter evan creat issu from file action to v6 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7440 add tempor selector function by dprotaso in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7434 fix dep updat modul googl golang org protobuf to v1 36 10 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7445 chore dep updat github codeql action action to v3 306 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7446 skip link check for acm org which block the link checker by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7444 feat log sdk observ otlploggrpc export metric by yumosx in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7353 fix dep updat golang org x to 27f1f14 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7448 fix dep updat googleapi to 7c0ddcb by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7449 chore dep updat modul github com grpc ecosystem grpc gateway v2 to v2 273 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7450 add exemplar reservoir parallel benchmark by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7441 chore dep updat modul github com ghostiam protogett to v0 3 17 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7451 chore dep updat action stale action to v10 10 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7452\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0760475a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"854c9731866cb9da\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.42807171129052857, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.26859932755789795, \"vector_similarity\": 0.80017394, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0760475a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:48\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"*   David also mentioned ongoing work on exponential histograms and a simpler \\\"last value\\\" PR that shares code with the histogram one.\\n\\n*   Tyler expressed a strong desire to merge the histogram reservoir PR in the current milestone due to its significant performance improvement and encouraged attendees to review it.\\n\\n**6. Milestone Check-in and Release Goals**\\n\\n*   Tyler conducted a check-in on the v1.39.0 milestones for [Otel](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/milestone/74) and [Contrib](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/milestone/33).\\n\\n*   **Exposed Temporality Selector Function PR:** Tyler noted that a previous SIG meeting concluded this PR was API pollution and should be closed. He will draft a comment and close it today.\\n\\n*   **Simple Span Processor (Tracing):** This PR needs another round of reviews but is considered straightforward and should remain in the milestone.\\n\\n*   **OTLP Metric GRPC Exporter Metrics:** This PR has been open for a while and needs more iteration. It might be moved out of the current milestone if a release push occurs.\\n\\n*   **Metrics SDK Standard Out Metrics Exporter & Standard Log Exporter:** Both PRs lack follow-up from their original authors and significant work is still needed. They are candidates for being bumped from the milestone.\\n\\n*   **Overall Release Strategy:** Tyler proposed making a release before KubeCon (less than a month away) and urged everyone to prioritize reviews for the critical PRs to achieve this goal.\\n\\n**7. KubeCon Discussion**\\n\\n*   **David Ashpole** asked if there was anything specific to announce or discuss at KubeCon.\\n\\n*   **Robert Pająk** mentioned the extended attributes merge in specification and product as something he'd like to highlight, though it's not ready.\\n\\n*   **Tyler Yahn** expressed interest in showcasing the new observability features.\\n\\n*   David suggested working towards a stable release of the HTTP instrumentation in Contrib. Tyler agreed it was a good idea but noted the significant work involved due to existing \\\"cruft\\\" and potential needs for API restructuring.\\n\\n**8. Tyler's Side Project (OTLP Exporter Error Types)**\\n\\n*   Tyler shared that he's been working on introducing new, custom error types for OTLP exporters to provide clearer, more unified error messages. This involves distinguishing between HTTP/gRPC errors, partial errors, and warnings. He has a prototype integrated for Otel Trace gRPC. While not critical, it improves observability and user understanding of errors.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"david also mention ongo work on exponenti histogram and a simpler last valu pr that share code with the histogram one tyler express a strong desir to merg the histogram reservoir pr in the current mileston due to it signific perform improv and encourag attende to review it 6 mileston check in and releas goal tyler conduct a check in on the v1 39 0 mileston for otel http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go mileston 74 and contrib http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib mileston 33 expos tempor selector function pr tyler note that a previous sig meet conclud this pr wa api pollut and should be close he will draft a comment and close it today simpl span processor trace this pr need anoth round of review but is consid straightforward and should remain in the mileston otlp metric grpc export metric this pr ha been open for a while and need more iter it might be move out of the current mileston if a releas push occur metric sdk standard out metric export standard log export both pr lack follow up from their origin author and signific work is still need they are candid for be bump from the mileston overal releas strategi tyler propos make a releas befor kubecon less than a month away and urg everyon to priorit review for the critic pr to achiev this goal 7 kubecon discuss david ashpol ask if there wa anyth specif to announc or discus at kubecon robert paj ą k mention the extend attribut merg in specif and product a someth he d like to highlight though it s not readi tyler yahn express interest in showcas the new observ featur david suggest work toward a stabl releas of the http instrument in contrib tyler agre it wa a good idea but note the signific work involv due to exist cruft and potenti need for api restructur 8 tyler s side project otlp export error type tyler share that he s been work on introduc new custom error type for otlp export to provid clearer more unifi error messag this involv distinguish between http grpc error partial error and warn he ha a prototyp integr for otel trace grpc while not critic it improv observ and user understand of error\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"073cfcdc8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"id\": \"1bed9e41a9b05e24\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.427280351342722, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2947642019181743, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7364847, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"073cfcdc8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 8756, \"chunk_count\": 4, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:19\", \"token_count\": 2164, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- `T004` — Custom configuration approach rejected `(SRC-NOTE-03, SRC-NOTE-04)`; selector functions shipped in `v1.39.0` via `#7434` `(SRC-REL-01)`.\\n\\n# WS-02: Metrics Performance\\n\\n**Status**: in_progress\\n\\n**Priority**: P0\\n\\n**Owner**: dashpole\\n\\n**Project**: opentelemetry-go\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-15\\n\\n## Sources\\n\\n- `SRC