 meet note entri 3479584781 md src note 07 entri 3581463689 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3581463689 md src mile 02 mileston 13145551 md opentelemetri mileston mileston 13145551 md src mile 03 mileston 13661613 md opentelemetri mileston mileston 13661613 md src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 md opentelemetri releas releas v1 39 0 md w 02 metric perform status in _ progress prioriti p0 owner dashpol project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 12 15\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"cf971b288a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"id\": \"6b45ca2c003646a7\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.41536483430357696, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.27514054614796707, \"vector_similarity\": 0.74255484, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"cf971b288a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"location\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 4565, \"chunk_count\": 9, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:48:43\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:37\", \"token_count\": 4834, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"work-state\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Fix `AddAttributes`, `SetAttributes`, `SetBody` on `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log` to not mutate input. (#7403)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0`. (#7655)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.36.0`. (#7656)\\n\\n### Removed\\n\\n- Drop support for [Go 1.23]. (#7274)\\n\\n- Remove the `FilterProcessor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. The `Enabled` method has been added to the `Processor` interface instead. All `Processor` implementations must now implement the `Enabled` method. Custom processors that do not filter records can implement `Enabled` to return `true`. (#7639)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetricgrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetrichttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp 7372 fix addattribut setattribut setbodi on record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log to not mutat input 7403 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7655 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 360 7656 remov drop support for go 123 7274 remov the filterprocessor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log the enabl method ha been ad to the processor interfac instead all processor implement must now implement the enabl method custom processor that do not filter record can implement enabl to return true 7639 sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0760475a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"d669b2e7414201e9\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4118076352252867, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2358932346075524, \"vector_similarity\": 0.82227457, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0760475a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:48\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Improve performance of histogram `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` when min and max are disabled using `NoMinMax`. (#7306)\\n\\n- Improve error handling for dropped data during translation by using `prometheus.NewInvalidMetric` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. ⚠️ **Breaking Change:** Previously, these cases were only logged and scrapes succeeded. Now, when translation would drop data (e.g., invalid label/value), the exporter emits a `NewInvalidMetric`, and Prometheus scrapes **fail with HTTP 500** by default. To preserve the prior behavior (scrapes succeed while errors are logged), configure your Prometheus HTTP handler with: `promhttp.HandlerOpts{ ErrorHandling: promhttp.ContinueOnError }`. (#7363)\\n\\n- Replace fnv hash with xxhash in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` for better performance. (#7371)\\n\\n- The default `TranslationStrategy` in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/prometheus` is changed from `otlptranslator.NoUTF8EscapingWithSuffixes` to `otlptranslator.UnderscoreEscapingWithSuffixes`. (#7421)\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n- Include W3C TraceFlags (bits 0–7) in the OTLP `Span.Flags` field in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp` and `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7438)\\n\\n- The `ErrorType` function in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0` now handles custom error types.\\n\\n  If an error implements an `ErrorType() string` method, the return value of that method will be used as the error type. (#7442)\\n\\n### Fixed\\n\\n- Fix `WithInstrumentationAttributes` options in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` to properly merge attributes when passed multiple times instead of replacing them. Attributes with duplicate keys will use the last value passed. (#7300)\\n\\n- The equality of `attribute.Set` when using the `Equal` method is not affected by the user 